text:
Good examples
Five records from a training seed, each from a different tuple, and one chosen for a sensor with implausible values, with messages written by hand:

Markdown('\n\n---\n\n'.join(map(example_md, EXAMPLES)))

{"farm": "Sítio Recanto", "date": "2026-07-23", "nodes": 40}
{"problem": "water stress", "location": "Block F, drip line F2", "pattern": "cluster", "severity": "early", "since": "since yesterday", "soil_water": "none since Tuesday", "nodes_flagged": 3, "nodes_in_group": 6, "amount": "some"}
{"problem": "water stress", "location": "Block C, drip line C3", "pattern": "cluster", "severity": "early", "since": "since today", "soil_water": "none since yesterday", "nodes_flagged": 7, "nodes_in_group": 7, "amount": "all"}

👀 Block F, drip line F2: some monitored plants on this line have shown first signs of water stress since yesterday, and no water has reached their soil since Tuesday. Check the line from its start to the last plant.
👀 Block C, drip line C3: all monitored plants on this line have shown first signs of water stress since today, and no water has reached their soil since yesterday. Check that the line delivers water when irrigation runs.


{"farm": "Fazenda Boa Vista", "date": "2026-05-16", "nodes": 21}
{"problem": "equipment fault", "location": "Plot 3, row 7", "pattern": "one node", "severity": "severe", "since": "since Tuesday", "fault": "missing data"}
{"problem": "water stress", "location": "Plot 1, row 1", "pattern": "one node", "severity": "moderate", "since": "since Thursday", "soil_water": "arriving"}

🚨 Plot 3, row 7: the sensors at this plant have sent no data since Tuesday, so it is not monitored. Check the node’s power and connection today.
⚠️ Plot 1, row 1: a monitored plant has shown water stress since Thursday, although its soil still gets water. Check the plant for heat damage, pests or root problems.


{"farm": "Sítio Recanto", "date": "2026-08-04", "nodes": 6}
{"problem": "equipment fault", "location": "whole farm", "pattern": "widespread", "severity": "severe", "since": "since Thursday", "fault": "missing data", "nodes_flagged": 6, "nodes_in_group": 6, "amount": "all"}

🚨 Whole farm: all sensors have sent no data since Thursday, so the farm is not monitored. Check the gateway and its power supply today.


{"farm": "Fazenda Cachoeira", "date": "2026-08-03", "nodes": 25}
{"problem": "equipment fault", "location": "Plot 1, row 2", "pattern": "one node", "severity": "early", "since": "since today", "fault": "implausible values", "sensor": "soil moisture"}

👀 Plot 1, row 2: the soil moisture sensor at this plant has given values that look wrong since today. Check that it sits firmly in the soil and is not damaged.


{"farm": "Sítio Bela Vista", "date": "2026-05-19", "nodes": 47}
{"problem": "water stress", "location": "Block C, row 4", "pattern": "one node", "severity": "early", "since": "since today", "soil_water": "none since Sunday"}
{"problem": "water stress", "location": "Block D, drip line D3", "pattern": "cluster", "severity": "early", "since": "since today", "soil_water": "arriving", "nodes_flagged": 6, "nodes_in_group": 7, "amount": "almost all"}

👀 Block C, row 4: a monitored plant has shown first signs of water stress since today, and no water has reached its soil since Sunday. Check that water reaches this plant when irrigation runs.
👀 Block D, drip line D3: almost all monitored plants on this line have shown first signs of water stress since today, although their soil still gets water. Check the plants for heat damage, pests or root problems.


{"farm": "Fazenda São João", "date": "2026-08-17", "nodes": 18}
{"problem": "water stress", "location": "whole farm", "pattern": "widespread", "severity": "early", "since": "since today", "soil_water": "none since Saturday", "nodes_flagged": 17, "nodes_in_group": 18, "amount": "almost all"}
{"problem": "equipment fault", "location": "Block D, row 24", "pattern": "one node", "severity": "early", "since": "since today", "fault": "camera view changed"}

👀 Whole farm: almost all monitored plants have shown first signs of water stress since today, and no water has reached their soil since Saturday. Check that irrigation runs as scheduled and that the water supply works.
👀 Block D, row 24: the camera at this plant has not seen its leaves since today. Check that it points at the plant and that nothing blocks its view.



Every example passes the code checks:

test_eq([[k for k, v in check(e['record'], e['message']).items() if not v] for e in EXAMPLES], [[]]*len(EXAMPLES))
